# RI-0059 (no-git-track-unbounded-binaries): the TIER-2 raw transcript archives are
# multi-MB gzips accumulated per session — they bloat history unboundedly and 408 the push.
# The TIER-1 dialogue .md snapshot (the SIGNAL) stays tracked; these raw archives do not.
